{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104335","id":2402192492,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6PLoxs","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104335","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104335.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104335.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104335","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104335/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104335/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104335/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f8d13c8a46d4da35b64e949ac8e199671edce322","number":104335,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Don't free already freed scenes when changing `SceneTree` current scene","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Changes tracking of the previous/pending scenes to use ObjectIDs instead of pointers, ensuring not trying to free/use already freed instances.\r\n\r\nFixes #104292.\r\n\r\nThe previous scene being freed manually by the user is kinda an expectable case / easy to be done (presented in #104292).\r\nThe pending scene being freed manually by the user seems very unlikely but still is possible. So makes sense to handle it gracefully as well.\r\n\r\nTest project including 2 crash cases this PR fixes: [current_scene_changing_crashes.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19328067/current_scene_changing_crashes.zip)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe logic still needs further improving as there are more not gracefully handled cases (potential crashes). E.g. `root->remove_child(current_scene);` is not guaranteed to succeed (`root` could be in blocked state). But leaving this for another PR / keeping this one simple for cherry-picking.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com